OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud
OL,6,Fthickening in the evening, with
OL,7,Foutbreaks of light rain or drizzle
OL,8,Fpossible at times. Rain moving in
OL,9,Ftowards dawn, but staying dry in the
OL,10,Feast. Mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FRain spreading eastwards
OL,13,Fthrough the morning, becoming
OL,14,Fwidespread and persistent. The rain
OL,15,Fgradually easing from the west through
OL,16,Fthe afternoon and persisting along
OL,17,Feastern coasts until after dark.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
